sequenceDiagram
    participant CPU
    participant ProcessA as Process A
    participant Dispatcher
    participant Scheduler
    participant ProcessB as Process B

    Dispatcher->>CPU: Start time slice for Process A
    CPU->>ProcessA: Execute instructions
    Note over CPU,ProcessA: Time slice expires
    CPU->>CPU: Complete current machine cycle
    CPU->>CPU: Save current process state
    CPU->>Dispatcher: Interrupt transfers control
    Dispatcher->>Scheduler: Identify ready processes
    Scheduler-->>Dispatcher: Select highest-priority ready process
    Dispatcher->>CPU: Start next time slice
    CPU->>ProcessB: Execute instructions
